NOTE ON THE DATA AND THE GENERATED FILES

The MIT licence above covers this project's own code and configuration.

Files generated from Jolpica data - f1-tracker/f1_calendar.h, f1_drivers.h,
f1_legends.h and f1_facts.h - are adaptations of data licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0,
and carry that licence rather than this one. See reference/CREDITS.md.

Circuit geometry (bacinger/f1-circuits) and flags (lipis/flag-icons) are MIT.
Driver and legend portraits come from Wikimedia Commons under their own
licences, each credited in f1-tracker/f1_portraits.h and on the card itself.

